body:
The slider integration for PercentField lacks test coverage. Given that this repository has comprehensive test coverage for field widgets (as seen in packages/fields/src/__tests__/), the new slider functionality should be covered by unit tests. Consider adding tests that verify:
1. Slider value synchronizes with input value
2. Slider respects disabled/readonly state
3. Slider changes trigger onChange callback correctly
4. Edge cases like null values are handled properly
```suggestion
    // Do not propagate changes when field is readonly or disabled
    if (readonly || props.disabled) return;

    if (!Array.isArray(values) || values.length === 0) {
      // Mirror text input behavior: empty selection -> null value
      onChange(null as any);
      return;
    }

    const raw = values[0];
    const nextValue = typeof raw === 'number' ? raw / 100 : null;
    onChange(nextValue as any);
```
